    sa: ["What is reconciliation with God and how is it achieved?", ["enemies", "christ", "cross", "peace", "initiative", "forgiven"], "A good answer says sin made us enemies of God, God took the initiative in Christ whose death on the cross reconciled us, giving peace, forgiveness and access, and this is the basis of reconciliation with others."],
